_011", "rxn_014"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_011", "mol_013"]}, {"pathway_id": "P7", "name": "Ornithine guanidinylation via guanidine", "description": "HCN + NH3 photolysis \u2192 guanidine; guanidine reacts with ornithine to yield arginine (as by analogy to cyanamide pathway)", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_008", "rxn_009", "rxn_010"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_008", "mol_011"]}, {"pathway_id": "P8", "name": "Ornithine from HCN polymer, urea/cyanate branch", "description": "HCN \u2192 urea/cyanate via photolysis; carbamoylation and modification of ornithine to arginine via citrulline", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_001", "rxn_008", "rxn_013", "rxn_012", "rxn_009", "rxn_011", "rxn_014"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_015", "mol_014", "mol_013"]}, {"pathway_id": "P9", "name": "Cyanosulfidic route with surplus cyanamide from photolysis", "description": "HCN + NH3 photolysis to cyanamide and guanidine, both feeding into guanidinylation of aminopropionitrile or ornithine depending on pool composition.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_008", "rxn_003", "rxn_006", "rxn_007"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_007", "mol_009", "mol_016"]}, {"pathway_id": "P10", "name": "Ornithine \u2192 arginine via speculative citrulline amidination and parallel guanidinylation", "description": "Ornithine from HCN polymer + cyanamide: can go via guanidinylation (rxn_010) or carbamoylation \u2192 citrulline \u2192 amidination (rxn_011, rxn_014); alternate functionalization routes.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_009", "rxn_010", "rxn_011", "rxn_014"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_011", "mol_013", "mol_007"]}], "hub_molecules": ["mol_007", "mol_011"], "convergence_points": [{"molecule_id": "mol_011", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_009"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_010", "rxn_011"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_007", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_008"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_003", "rxn_005", "rxn_010", "rxn_013", "rxn_014"]}]}, "reasoning": "", "duration_ms": 55468.24240684509, "success": true, "error_message": null}
